"color", "actor", "prop": same allowed values as in the English JSON; you may change them to fit the new scene.

Total voice-over about the same length as the English (similar number of lines per chapter).

OUTPUT ONLY one JSON object, no prose, no code fence, same schema as the English JSON, with "id": "<ID>vi", "lang": "vi", Vietnamese "title" (<= 70 chars) and "description".

